📌 Project Overview

This project analyzes pizza sales performance across categories, sizes, months, and product types using Power BI.
I completed the entire workflow manually — including data cleaning, modeling, DAX calculations, and dashboard design — without using any AI tools.

The goal was to understand customer preferences, top-selling pizzas, revenue drivers, and monthly sales trends.

🔧 Tools & Techniques Used

Power BI Desktop

Power Query (ETL)

DAX (manual calculations)

Data Modeling (Star Schema)

Interactive Visualizations

