📈 Key Insights

Large-size pizzas contribute the highest revenue.

Sales peak in July and drop gradually between October–December.

Classic & Supreme categories dominate in total revenue.

Chicken pizzas are top performers in quantity and revenue.

The Spicy Italian Pizza is the highest revenue-generating item.

